TranslationUnitDecl
|-ClassTemplateDecl P
| |-TemplateTypeParmDecl referenced class depth 0 index 0 T
| |-TemplateTypeParmDecl referenced class depth 0 index 1 U
| | `-TemplateArgument type 'T *'
| |-CXXRecordDecl struct P definition
| | |-FieldDecl t 'T'
| | `-FieldDecl u 'U'
| `-ClassTemplateSpecializationDecl struct P definition implicit_instantiation
|   |-TemplateArgument type 'char'
|   |-TemplateArgument type 'char *'
|   |-FieldDecl t 'char'
|   `-FieldDecl u 'char *'
`-StaticAssertDecl
  `-BinaryOperator 'bool' '=='
    |-UnaryExprOrTypeTraitExpr 'unsigned long' sizeof 'P<char>'
    `-BinaryOperator 'unsigned long' '*'
      |-ImplicitCastExpr 'unsigned long' <IntegralCast>
      | `-IntegerLiteral 'int' 2
      `-UnaryExprOrTypeTraitExpr 'unsigned long' sizeof 'void *'
